  "summary_en": "NSW Government cyber security end-user guidance on public generative AI tools such as DALL-E. It sets do's and don'ts for public servants: verify outputs, protect personal and sensitive information, avoid AI decision-making, respect copyright, and escalate to IT security teams when unsure.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Do not allow generative AI to make decisions for the NSW Government",
   "Do not input personal, official, sensitive, classified or health information",
   "Fact check and verify outputs before official use",
   "Do not use AI-generated code in government systems or ingest government datasets without approval",
   "Enable multifactor authentication and disable training, logging and chat history"
